  "description": "The Falco Pro is a great choice for training, leisure riding, commuting, or even as an entry level race bike. A frame built for confident handling with relaxed road geometry paired to drop bars gives a sporty feel with plenty of hand placement options. The hydroformed 6061 alloy frame fitted with a full carbon fork makes for very lightweight heart and Internally routed cables and headset giving a clean look.\nBuilt using Shimano’s Tiagra 20 speed gearing and Tektro dual pivot road calipers the Falco has smooth and reliable shifting and all the stopping power you need. The compact 50/34 forged chainset matched to 11-32t cassette gives all the range you’ll need with a sealed bottom bracket to keep things reliable.\nKenda 28c all season tyres make for reliable grip all year round, mounted to our Reid double wall rim brake wheelset to give a light and lively ride. The Falco Pro is a pure road bike with stunning performance.",
